            wikitext: "==Variants==\n[[gw:Critical Eye|Critical Eye]] \n*When using Critical Eye variation, replace Critical Strike with Critical Eye. (With the 13x% extra critical strikes, Critical Strike becomes useless.)\n[[gw:Vital Boon|Vital Boon]]\n\n",
            text: "Variants Critical Eye When using Critical Eye variation, replace Critical Strike with Critical Eye. (With the 13x% extra critical strikes, Critical Strike becomes useless.) Vital Boon",
